Description: Howdy-style face login for libcamera/ISP and UVC cameras
 Face authentication for Linux rebuilt for machines where the camera is
 not a plain UVC webcam: libcamera/ISP sensors (e.g. Qualcomm CAMSS
 OV02C10 + HM1092 IR with flash illuminator) as well as ordinary USB
 webcams. CPU-only YuNet + SFace recognition, PAM integration with
 password fallback, per-machine profiles.
